# decode.sh runs under WSL and on the Mac. The PC's git has autocrlf=true, which
# would hand it a CRLF working tree on checkout and break the shebang outright
# ("bad interpreter"), so pin these to LF.
#
# Scoped to this directory on purpose. A repo-wide `* text=auto eol=lf` would
# renormalise legacy/, lib/TOTP/ and blackjack_face.c, which are genuinely CRLF
# in the index upstream, into a large spurious diff — see CLAUDE.md.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
